	(descr "Adafruit microSD Card BFF Product 5683, fixed flat underside hand-fit. Exact 17.78 x 20.701 mm module outline and two 7-position 2.54 mm castellated rows derived from Adafruit's published Eagle PCB revision B. Functional harness pads: 1 SCK, 2 MISO, 3 MOSI, 4 3V3, 5 GND, 6 TX/CS. Eight additional unnumbered lands are mechanical only. Place on B.Cu with CARD ACCESS toward the harness top edge. Source: https://github.com/adafruit/Adafruit-microSD-Card-BFF-PCB")
